name "Fortunal"
description "Houten vissersboot"
notes "
	Type: Modern fishing trawler
	Size: 19x4x8m 
	Sunk: 10. April 1997. 

	\"Fortunal\" unfortunately did not live up to it's name. It struck the coast in 1997 due to navigational error and sunk in just a few minutes. Now it lies upright on the north side of island Vis.  Notable: Fortunal is still filled with fishing gear and crew belongings so it offers us a a nice window into the daily life of fisherman, as well as a look at massive Scorpion Fishes that litter the wreck today. "
